(6351230, 939913, 108544, '<td valign="top">Love the Grittiness of this image! The spacing is great!<br/>This really hits me.</td>', 'Love the Grittiness of this image! The spacing is great!This really hits me.', '2011-03-14 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351231, 940532, 93283, '<td valign="top">A simple lens-baby type effect. I like it and think it works for this image. Keeps the focus on the nature and the concrete. Well Done</td>', 'A simple lens-baby type effect. I like it and think it works for this image. Keeps the focus on the nature and the concrete. Well Done', '2011-03-14 20:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351232, 940549, 93283, '<td valign="top">Umm... WoW... Killer capture and perfectly appropriate for this challenge... BOOYAH... A 10</td>', 'Umm... WoW... Killer capture and perfectly appropriate for this challenge... BOOYAH... A 10', '2011-03-14 20:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351233, 940542, 17837, '<td valign="top">A good try at what seems to be urban nature, unfortunetly there are a few things working against this photo. The color balance seems off to me, and the flash seems to be too harsh on the plant life. I am also distracted by the cars on the top of the photo, and would suggest possibly cropping them out. All in all, an average photo. Hope this critique helps!</td>', 'A good try at what seems to be urban nature, unfortunetly there are a few things working against this photo. The color balance seems off to me, and the flash seems to be too harsh on the plant life. I am also distracted by the cars on the top of the photo, and would suggest possibly cropping them out. All in all, an average photo. Hope this critique helps!', '2011-03-14 20:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351234, 940296, 108544, '<td valign="top">I love when images, look like sequences. The three flying pigeons really tie this together. <br/>Excellent...</td>', 'I love when images, look like sequences. The three flying pigeons really tie this together. Excellent...', '2011-03-14 20:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351236, 939853, 93283, '<td valign="top">Good focus and its nice and sharp. The car, street, and rose work well for this challenge. Looks a little dark but I am on my laptop so perhaps its my end. Overall a very nice capture</td>', 'Good focus and its nice and sharp. The car, street, and rose work well for this challenge. Looks a little dark but I am on my laptop so perhaps its my end. Overall a very nice capture', '2011-03-14 20:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351238, 940021, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot works well for the challenge, its nicely composed and sharp. The reflection in the window adds to the urban effect. Well Done 7</td>', 'This shot works well for the challenge, its nicely composed and sharp. The reflection in the window adds to the urban effect. Well Done 7', '2011-03-14 20:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351239, 940426, 17837, '<td valign="top">A good attempt, however I do not feel that the plants are the subject in this photo. Certainly an interesting perspective though.</td>', 'A good attempt, however I do not feel that the plants are the subject in this photo. Certainly an interesting perspective though.', '2011-03-14 20:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351243, 939769, 93283, '<td valign="top">The shadows on the bricks work perfectly for this challenge. The green bushes at the bottom could have been cropped out and I think that would have really made this image. Overall still a good concept. 6</td>', 'The shadows on the bricks work perfectly for this challenge. The green bushes at the bottom could have been cropped out and I think that would have really made this image. Overall still a good concept. 6', '2011-03-14 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351245, 940237, 93283, '<td valign="top">Interesting color and texture on this shot. Meets the challenge and has nice DoF. 6</td>', 'Interesting color and texture on this shot. Meets the challenge and has nice DoF. 6', '2011-03-14 20:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351247, 940429, 17837, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective. Great exposure, and the soft focus around the edges works well; however, I do not feel that this photo meets the requirements of the challenge at hand. There is no "urban" setting here.</td>', 'Love the perspective. Great exposure, and the soft focus around the edges works well; however, I do not feel that this photo meets the requirements of the challenge at hand. There is no "urban" setting here.', '2011-03-14 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351249, 940576, 93283, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, especially on the right side of the photo, the lines work really well. I personally think that if you had cropped an inch off of the left side, it would have looked a little less cluttered, but that''s just my opinion. Overall an interesting capture 6</td>', 'Interesting composition, especially on the right side of the photo, the lines work really well. I personally think that if you had cropped an inch off of the left side, it would have looked a little less cluttered, but that''s just my opinion. Overall an interesting capture 6', '2011-03-14 20:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351250, 939722, 108544, '<td valign="top">I really like how the green pops! Very nice focus work and composition. Although, I''m wondering if a lower angle, may have been better. This way, not showing the lower debris. I do understand, why it''s their. It''s just sometimes simple, can go a long way. Maybe next time... Either way, I do like the shot, good job...</td>', 'I really like how the green pops! Very nice focus work and composition. Although, I''m wondering if a lower angle, may have been better. This way, not showing the lower debris. I do understand, why it''s their. It''s just sometimes simple, can go a long way. Maybe next time... Either way, I do like the shot, good job...', '2011-03-14 20:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351251, 940303, 93283, '<td valign="top">Urban and Nature... and a Beautiful bird... Good shot</td>', 'Urban and Nature... and a Beautiful bird... Good shot', '2011-03-14 20:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6351252, 940564, 93283, '<td valign="top">You have urban... and nature... and good DoF. Interesting lines in the unfocused area as well... 6</td>', 'You have urban... and nature... and good DoF. Interesting lines in the unfocused area as well... 6', '2011-03-14 20:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
