(6353754, 940563, 115613, '<td valign="top">Peace in the city, a wonderful thing to wish for, that''s a 9</td>', 'Peace in the city, a wonderful thing to wish for, that''s a 9', '2011-03-16 20:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353773, 940458, 16106, '<td valign="top">This image lacks critters, so this may get overlooked in the voting, but this one has all the goods. The subtle colors are beautifully handled, the framing is great and the textures are amazing. Top 3 for me</td>', 'This image lacks critters, so this may get overlooked in the voting, but this one has all the goods. The subtle colors are beautifully handled, the framing is great and the textures are amazing. Top 3 for me', '2011-03-16 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353778, 940441, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you included the stone on the right in the composition instead of framing it with more brick to the left. That said this is one of my top 3 great subtle colors and i can practically feel the textures. The tones of the quatrefoil really set off the pigeons feathers and the way their eye colors tie into the colors in the bricks is just great. Im guessing blue.</td>', 'I wonder why you included the stone on the right in the composition instead of framing it with more brick to the left. That said this is one of my top 3 great subtle colors and i can practically feel the textures. The tones of the quatrefoil really set off the pigeons feathers and the way their eye colors tie into the colors in the bricks is just great. Im guessing blue.', '2011-03-16 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353792, 940549, 16106, '<td valign="top">Definitely the best critter shot in the challenge, you cant beat eagles and getting two of them in range is a stroke of fortune, capturing them at just the right moment speaks of skill. My only knock is the saturation of the sky. I know this is the color of the sky when captured with long glass on a clear day, but it is just so jarring that I feel it hurts the image, the purity of the color wrestles the eye away from these magnificent birds. Had you muted the blue down a bit, or gone whole hog and converted to B&amp;W (as I did with my much more prosaic bird shot with the over blue sky) it would have been the pick for the top spot. As is top five.</td>', 'Definitely the best critter shot in the challenge, you cant beat eagles and getting two of them in range is a stroke of fortune, capturing them at just the right moment speaks of skill. My only knock is the saturation of the sky. I know this is the color of the sky when captured with long glass on a clear day, but it is just so jarring that I feel it hurts the image, the purity of the color wrestles the eye away from these magnificent birds. Had you muted the blue down a bit, or gone whole hog and converted to B&W (as I did with my much more prosaic bird shot with the over blue sky) it would have been the pick for the top spot. As is top five.', '2011-03-16 20:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353793, 940447, 16106, '<td valign="top">Pure poetry. Just a lovely composition, something that I would have walked past without seeing has been saved by your way of seeing. Subtle and beautifully framed.</td>', 'Pure poetry. Just a lovely composition, something that I would have walked past without seeing has been saved by your way of seeing. Subtle and beautifully framed.', '2011-03-16 20:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353795, 940390, 16106, '<td valign="top">I do like the contrasting colors and the framing, but the orange cast in the birds feathers makes him look like he has been dusted in powdered paint.</td>', 'I do like the contrasting colors and the framing, but the orange cast in the birds feathers makes him look like he has been dusted in powdered paint.', '2011-03-16 20:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353798, 939913, 16106, '<td valign="top">yet another of my personal top ten that truly speaks to the way wildlife is sen in an urban environment. The action all taking place on the perifery of the frame and the strong grain really work.</td>', 'yet another of my personal top ten that truly speaks to the way wildlife is sen in an urban environment. The action all taking place on the perifery of the frame and the strong grain really work.', '2011-03-16 20:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353800, 940523, 16106, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean and great DOF control. I wonder if i might have liked it a bit better if the concrete had not been completely de-saturated, but either way it is a well seen and presented image.</td>', 'Simple, clean and great DOF control. I wonder if i might have liked it a bit better if the concrete had not been completely de-saturated, but either way it is a well seen and presented image.', '2011-03-16 20:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353816, 940524, 12674, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot but lacks an urban feel.</td>', 'Beautiful shot but lacks an urban feel.', '2011-03-16 20:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353875, 940597, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool bird!  And certainly looks to be in a dangerous place.  I might lighten up the "face" a bit since it''s so shadowed, but it''s an interesting image.</td>', 'Cool bird!  And certainly looks to be in a dangerous place.  I might lighten up the "face" a bit since it''s so shadowed, but it''s an interesting image.', '2011-03-16 21:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353878, 940195, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wild rabbits don''t fare well no matter where they live :-(</td>', 'Wild rabbits don''t fare well no matter where they live :-(', '2011-03-16 21:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353882, 940458, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks more rural than urban to me, but nature has a way of infiltrating anything manmade eventually.</td>', 'Looks more rural than urban to me, but nature has a way of infiltrating anything manmade eventually.', '2011-03-16 21:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353884, 940569, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the image, but I''m not seeing anything urban in the scene.  Could be I''m just missing it.</td>', 'Like the image, but I''m not seeing anything urban in the scene.  Could be I''m just missing it.', '2011-03-16 21:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353885, 940570, 65234, '<td valign="top">They''re *everywhere* !</td>', 'They''re *everywhere* !', '2011-03-16 21:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353891, 940080, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bet you could have found a House Sparrow *in* the WalMart, too LOL!  The sparrow looks a little too dark on my screen.</td>', 'Bet you could have found a House Sparrow *in* the WalMart, too LOL!  The sparrow looks a little too dark on my screen.', '2011-03-16 21:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353893, 940118, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice find for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice find for this challenge.', '2011-03-16 21:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353897, 940571, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the otter.  But ... I wish there was something in the image to give it an urban context for this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot of the otter.  But ... I wish there was something in the image to give it an urban context for this challenge.', '2011-03-16 21:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353912, 940303, 65234, '<td valign="top">That does not look like a comfortable roost!</td>', 'That does not look like a comfortable roost!', '2011-03-16 21:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353932, 940152, 33672, '<td valign="top">Odd crop detracts.</td>', 'Odd crop detracts.', '2011-03-16 21:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353934, 940140, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great take on the theme.</td>', 'Great take on the theme.', '2011-03-16 21:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353937, 940523, 33672, '<td valign="top">Selective desat fit this well.</td>', 'Selective desat fit this well.', '2011-03-16 22:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353941, 940408, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well that''s different!</td>', 'Well that''s different!', '2011-03-16 22:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353956, 940390, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute pose.  I think I want a closer crop, though.  I don''t think there needs to be quite so much building in the shot.</td>', 'Cute pose.  I think I want a closer crop, though.  I don''t think there needs to be quite so much building in the shot.', '2011-03-16 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353962, 940598, 65234, '<td valign="top">Squirrels and trees are not strictly urban.  I think this needs a bit of context to better fit the challenge.</td>', 'Squirrels and trees are not strictly urban.  I think this needs a bit of context to better fit the challenge.', '2011-03-16 22:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353964, 940429, 65234, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable!  Not seeing much "urban" in this, though.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable!  Not seeing much "urban" in this, though.', '2011-03-16 22:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353979, 940598, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice comp.</td>', 'Very nice comp.', '2011-03-16 22:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6353981, 940440, 65234, '<td valign="top">Bad bird!  Thanks for the smile :-)</td>', 'Bad bird!  Thanks for the smile :-)', '2011-03-16 22:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354130, 940408, 102534, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your Blue! Amazing structure</td>', 'Congrats on your Blue! Amazing structure', '2011-03-17 01:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354339, 940549, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured.  My only issue is the horizontal crop is a little tight and cramps your subject.</td>', 'Nicely captured.  My only issue is the horizontal crop is a little tight and cramps your subject.', '2011-03-17 08:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354409, 940548, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh! The advantage of living near the Temple of Angkor or such! But is it urban still? An irresistible picture, a touch muddy though. 8</td>', 'Oh! The advantage of living near the Temple of Angkor or such! But is it urban still? An irresistible picture, a touch muddy though. 8', '2011-03-17 10:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354411, 940337, 124815, '<td valign="top">If this is for real, I salute you!</td>', 'If this is for real, I salute you!', '2011-03-17 10:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354412, 940597, 124815, '<td valign="top">A great image</td>', 'A great image', '2011-03-17 10:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354415, 939558, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very powerful. Too bad it''s real! 9</td>', 'Very powerful. Too bad it''s real! 9', '2011-03-17 10:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354416, 940348, 124815, '<td valign="top">In Paris birds eat croissants so they don''t grow these amazing wings! 8</td>', 'In Paris birds eat croissants so they don''t grow these amazing wings! 8', '2011-03-17 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354418, 940441, 124815, '<td valign="top">I almost love here these "dirty" birds of the cities. But the color of the plumage .... and the pose ... I wished for the extreme right wall to be a touch darker (my 2 cents) 9</td>', 'I almost love here these "dirty" birds of the cities. But the color of the plumage .... and the pose ... I wished for the extreme right wall to be a touch darker (my 2 cents) 9', '2011-03-17 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354420, 940296, 124815, '<td valign="top">Great as a photo, a terrible things if you live behind these closed windows! A very telling lovely picture. 9</td>', 'Great as a photo, a terrible things if you live behind these closed windows! A very telling lovely picture. 9', '2011-03-17 10:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354426, 940021, 124815, '<td valign="top">Romantic</td>', 'Romantic', '2011-03-17 10:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354432, 940563, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wished for a bit more clarity - a very good picture though</td>', 'Wished for a bit more clarity - a very good picture though', '2011-03-17 10:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354433, 939940, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Love that swirly effect on the wing pattern.  I admit I would like just a bit of urban context for this challenge, but pigeons are so stereotypically urban I may just let that slide ;-)</td>', 'Cool shot!  Love that swirly effect on the wing pattern.  I admit I would like just a bit of urban context for this challenge, but pigeons are so stereotypically urban I may just let that slide ;-)', '2011-03-17 10:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354440, 940195, 124815, '<td valign="top">haunting image. Is it in the city?</td>', 'haunting image. Is it in the city?', '2011-03-17 10:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354441, 940302, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; not saying "urban" to me.</td>', 'Nice shot; not saying "urban" to me.', '2011-03-17 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354442, 940564, 124815, '<td valign="top">A classic. 7</td>', 'A classic. 7', '2011-03-17 10:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354445, 940540, 124815, '<td valign="top">Restraint and well felt.</td>', 'Restraint and well felt.', '2011-03-17 10:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354446, 940458, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very photogenic.</td>', 'Very photogenic.', '2011-03-17 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354448, 940152, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very cute expression.  Looks like he''s contemplating a bite of a leather jacket.</td>', 'Very cute expression.  Looks like he''s contemplating a bite of a leather jacket.', '2011-03-17 10:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354450, 940309, 124815, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2011-03-17 10:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354451, 940140, 124815, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, THEY are everywhere! 8</td>', 'Oh boy, THEY are everywhere! 8', '2011-03-17 10:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354454, 940369, 124815, '<td valign="top">Sentry! Counting on it. 8</td>', 'Sentry! Counting on it. 8', '2011-03-17 10:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354455, 940348, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great pose and caption. Very good image for this challenge.</td>', 'LOL!  Great pose and caption. Very good image for this challenge.', '2011-03-17 10:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354459, 940575, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s mesmerizing - a touch more saturation would have charmed me more. 8</td>', 'It''s mesmerizing - a touch more saturation would have charmed me more. 8', '2011-03-17 10:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354467, 939648, 65234, '<td valign="top">They can build nests in the darndest places!  Good find.</td>', 'They can build nests in the darndest places!  Good find.', '2011-03-17 10:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354472, 940356, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good subject; I think it needs a tad more DOF.</td>', 'Good subject; I think it needs a tad more DOF.', '2011-03-17 10:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354475, 940579, 65234, '<td valign="top">Much more impressive than a plastic Flamingo ;-)</td>', 'Much more impressive than a plastic Flamingo ;-)', '2011-03-17 10:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354478, 940447, 65234, '<td valign="top">LOVE the shadow on the wall; great way to visually integrate urban and nature.</td>', 'LOVE the shadow on the wall; great way to visually integrate urban and nature.', '2011-03-17 10:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354482, 940021, 65234, '<td valign="top">The reflection in the window really solidifies the urban setting in my mind.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'The reflection in the window really solidifies the urban setting in my mind.  Nicely composed.', '2011-03-17 11:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354483, 940346, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very interesting image!  I like the reflection as a way of incorporating the nature into the scene.</td>', 'Very interesting image!  I like the reflection as a way of incorporating the nature into the scene.', '2011-03-17 11:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354484, 940509, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looking through the window on a rainy day, admiring the light through the leaves and raindrops and only dimly aware of passers-by or those buildings you''ve seen a million times before.</td>', 'Looking through the window on a rainy day, admiring the light through the leaves and raindrops and only dimly aware of passers-by or those buildings you''ve seen a million times before.', '2011-03-17 11:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354486, 940369, 65234, '<td valign="top">Dramatic light!  Very nice find for this challenge.</td>', 'Dramatic light!  Very nice find for this challenge.', '2011-03-17 11:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354489, 940383, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the dappled light here.  Looks like old urban, with a nice contrast of fresh young green things.</td>', 'Love the dappled light here.  Looks like old urban, with a nice contrast of fresh young green things.', '2011-03-17 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354491, 940549, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Those talons =:-O  I do see Bald Eagles in relatively urban areas but usually in trees or way up in the sky.  Congrats on finding some manmade context for these beauties!</td>', 'Yikes!  Those talons =:-O  I do see Bald Eagles in relatively urban areas but usually in trees or way up in the sky.  Congrats on finding some manmade context for these beauties!', '2011-03-17 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354492, 940309, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light and composition.</td>', 'Nice light and composition.', '2011-03-17 11:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354493, 940599, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing Thing.  Kind of like the composition better with the dark bottom cropped out, but it does make clear that the Thing is on a manmade surface.</td>', 'Very intriguing Thing.  Kind of like the composition better with the dark bottom cropped out, but it does make clear that the Thing is on a manmade surface.', '2011-03-17 11:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354497, 940563, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great perspective to tie all the elements together.</td>', 'Great perspective to tie all the elements together.', '2011-03-17 11:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354498, 939815, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the grand, sweeping curves and the lone Egret.</td>', 'Love the grand, sweeping curves and the lone Egret.', '2011-03-17 11:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354500, 939913, 65234, '<td valign="top">Stuck in the smog :-(</td>', 'Stuck in the smog :-(', '2011-03-17 11:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354501, 940519, 65234, '<td valign="top">Weeds don''t seem to need much to survive, do they?  Nicely composed and perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Weeds don''t seem to need much to survive, do they?  Nicely composed and perfect for this challenge.', '2011-03-17 11:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354502, 940296, 65234, '<td valign="top">I know not everyone likes pigeons but I can''t imagine a city without them.  So I like this bit of urban nature, with the pigeons in various poses, ready to squash themselves onto tiny ledges.  Except for the clever one who gets a lamp to himself ;-)</td>', 'I know not everyone likes pigeons but I can''t imagine a city without them.  So I like this bit of urban nature, with the pigeons in various poses, ready to squash themselves onto tiny ledges.  Except for the clever one who gets a lamp to himself ;-)', '2011-03-17 11:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354504, 940267, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of tenacious plants here.</td>', 'Lots of tenacious plants here.', '2011-03-17 11:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354505, 940396, 65234, '<td valign="top">"Golden" leapt to mind even before I read your title :-)  Nice light on him!</td>', '"Golden" leapt to mind even before I read your title :-)  Nice light on him!', '2011-03-17 11:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354506, 940448, 65234, '<td valign="top">How cute!  A Public Display of Affection ... with pigeons LOL :-)</td>', 'How cute!  A Public Display of Affection ... with pigeons LOL :-)', '2011-03-17 11:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354508, 940400, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the delicate, airy greenery and the rusted metal pipe.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the delicate, airy greenery and the rusted metal pipe.', '2011-03-17 11:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354624, 939940, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2011-03-17 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354650, 940520, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh, nice capture!</td>', 'Oh, nice capture!', '2011-03-17 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354703, 940080, 83313, '<td valign="top">The bird seems clearer and more detailed than in the original shot you showed me. I assume you did a reedit. Looks good. (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'The bird seems clearer and more detailed than in the original shot you showed me. I assume you did a reedit. Looks good. (No vote, comment only)', '2011-03-17 14:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354714, 940408, 83313, '<td valign="top">Where was this when we had the Bizzarchitecture challenge!?</td>', 'Where was this when we had the Bizzarchitecture challenge!?', '2011-03-17 14:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354716, 940589, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is one of those cases where the title adds significantly to my appreciation of the image. Well seen.</td>', 'This is one of those cases where the title adds significantly to my appreciation of the image. Well seen.', '2011-03-17 14:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354728, 940210, 129800, '<td valign="top">Luv the colors and lighting.  This is a sparkling &amp; capturing picture.<br/> <br/>Thanks for taking it!</td>', 'Luv the colors and lighting.  This is a sparkling & capturing picture. Thanks for taking it!', '2011-03-17 14:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354729, 940445, 129800, '<td valign="top">Spring has sprung.   Luv the colors and seeing the plants.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Spring has sprung.   Luv the colors and seeing the plants.  Thanks for sharing.', '2011-03-17 14:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354732, 940509, 129800, '<td valign="top">Really enjoyed the softness and reminder.   Nic pic.</td>', 'Really enjoyed the softness and reminder.   Nic pic.', '2011-03-17 14:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6354771, 940348, 103004, '<td valign="top">haha nice!</td>', 'haha nice!', '2011-03-17 15:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
