(6357927, 940597, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really wish you would have cropped down from the top on this one. I love negative space, but it doesn''t seem to add to the shot. The bird and the barbed wire are wonderful, but the diagonal keeps drawing my eye up and out of the picture. 7 as is -- probably would have been an 8 with a better crop.<br/> <br/>(strangely enough, if the pipe didn''t have the ring around it from where it''s fitted together, I would have liked the negative space. :)</td>', 'I really wish you would have cropped down from the top on this one. I love negative space, but it doesn''t seem to add to the shot. The bird and the barbed wire are wonderful, but the diagonal keeps drawing my eye up and out of the picture. 7 as is -- probably would have been an 8 with a better crop. (strangely enough, if the pipe didn''t have the ring around it from where it''s fitted together, I would have liked the negative space. :)', '2011-03-20 21:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
