(6358196, 940408, 96751, '<td valign="top">How incredibly quirky.  And as <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> said, funky.  Congrats on your HM, Christophe.</td>', 'How incredibly quirky.  And as  bvy said, funky.  Congrats on your HM, Christophe.', '2011-03-21 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358201, 939940, 124815, '<td valign="top">Now show me the birds in flight Ben! Never thought of pigeon being urban only. I think of them as messengers mostly (I''m always looking on the bright side) or cooked ("fillet de pigeons roti et foie gras"). The city ones are the parasites, going for a free lunch. Boy, you do have a tendency for opening great discussions! Your magnificent pigeon just stole a rose to deliver to the princess in the tower!<br/></td>', 'Now show me the birds in flight Ben! Never thought of pigeon being urban only. I think of them as messengers mostly (I''m always looking on the bright side) or cooked ("fillet de pigeons roti et foie gras"). The city ones are the parasites, going for a free lunch. Boy, you do have a tendency for opening great discussions! Your magnificent pigeon just stole a rose to deliver to the princess in the tower!', '2011-03-21 00:26:27.000000', NULL, 0),
