(6358299, 940597, 8759, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Hey Tibi, I did not stay up charting the moon for nothing! Congrats! I am your 9! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>WOW Thank you very much!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Hey Tibi, I did not stay up charting the moon for nothing! Congrats! I am your 9!   WOW Thank you very much!!!', '2011-03-21 00:57:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358303, 940565, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the light!</td>', 'Love the light!', '2011-03-21 00:58:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358314, 940497, 124815, '<td valign="top">So this was for real! Congratulations for such a great tribute. A generation hard to replace. Filled me with memories. Reminded me of Jean Giono''s L''homme qui plantait des arbres.</td>', 'So this was for real! Congratulations for such a great tribute. A generation hard to replace. Filled me with memories. Reminded me of Jean Giono''s L''homme qui plantait des arbres.', '2011-03-21 01:00:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358315, 940296, 58785, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Very nice photo :)</td>', 'Congrats. Very nice photo :)', '2011-03-21 01:00:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358317, 940429, 123348, '<td valign="top">That is just precious! Love this image and it''s pure photography! Wonderful! Congratulations on your red!</td>', 'That is just precious! Love this image and it''s pure photography! Wonderful! Congratulations on your red!', '2011-03-21 01:01:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358321, 940447, 108525, '<td valign="top">This was one of my highest rated in the challenge!  It should have done much better.<br/> <br/>I agree with others in that it is something easily missed. A totally different perspective that most would not even think of.</td>', 'This was one of my highest rated in the challenge!  It should have done much better. I agree with others in that it is something easily missed. A totally different perspective that most would not even think of.', '2011-03-21 01:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358349, 940195, 16106, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this as much as the bird wings at Plymouth (which I love) but the two of them have the makings of an interesting series. Luck rabbit''s foot, on the wing of a bird, pretty laden symbolism for road kill.</td>', 'I don''t like this as much as the bird wings at Plymouth (which I love) but the two of them have the makings of an interesting series. Luck rabbit''s foot, on the wing of a bird, pretty laden symbolism for road kill.', '2011-03-21 01:13:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358402, 940575, 124815, '<td valign="top">On second thoughts, I like it just as it is. For me it was top of the line and I placed it visually in the mental drawer where I keep Tarkovsky and that''s a superlative</td>', 'On second thoughts, I like it just as it is. For me it was top of the line and I placed it visually in the mental drawer where I keep Tarkovsky and that''s a superlative', '2011-03-21 01:23:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358404, 940369, 46778, '<td valign="top">Great image and finish.</td>', 'Great image and finish.', '2011-03-21 01:24:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358425, 939940, 68504, '<td valign="top">the right angle, the right moment and the right pigeon. and you prolly weren''t even looking for it.<br/></td>', 'the right angle, the right moment and the right pigeon. and you prolly weren''t even looking for it.', '2011-03-21 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358428, 940296, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cyberlandz:</b></div><hr/><i> I like the mood of the photo. The selective blur works well, but some of the birds seem oversharpened. Overall a really nice photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No selective blur was added, it was the super-shallow depth of field (f/1.2) that created the out of focus area :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Cyberlandz: I like the mood of the photo. The selective blur works well, but some of the birds seem oversharpened. Overall a really nice photo.   No selective blur was added, it was the super-shallow depth of field (f/1.2) that created the out of focus area :)', '2011-03-21 01:36:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358429, 940195, 68504, '<td valign="top">nice foot, awesome bones,</td>', 'nice foot, awesome bones,', '2011-03-21 01:36:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6358438, 940429, 112972, '<td valign="top">Love how you have framed them with a foreground blur.  Congrats!</td>', 'Love how you have framed them with a foreground blur.  Congrats!', '2011-03-21 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 0),
