(6358750, 940296, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> wow, two blues! Congrats Allen a very rare feat (maybe the first ever?). Fabulous image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not the first (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=16241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">whiteroom</a> has achieved this), but a rare achievement indeed. I was shocked to see this win a blue. I thought this photo was for me. ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: wow, two blues! Congrats Allen a very rare feat (maybe the first ever?). Fabulous image.   Not the first ( whiteroom has achieved this), but a rare achievement indeed. I was shocked to see this win a blue. I thought this photo was for me. ;)', '2011-03-21 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
