(6795297, 940509, 16912, '<td valign="top">Well, this image brings an ironic smile to my face Margaret. A little too sharp in places to be seen as similar to another photographers work (you know where I''m coming from) but yet manages to bridge the gap twixt blurry and dpc sharp nicely - now, lets see a B&amp;W version ;)</td>', 'Well, this image brings an ironic smile to my face Margaret. A little too sharp in places to be seen as similar to another photographers work (you know where I''m coming from) but yet manages to bridge the gap twixt blurry and dpc sharp nicely - now, lets see a B&W version ;)', '2012-06-14 16:11:39.000000', NULL, 0);
